---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Teaching
permalink: /teaching/
---

<div class="page-header">
  <div class="section-label">Education</div>
  <h1>Courses &amp; Teaching</h1>
  <p>Graduate and undergraduate courses taught by MIST Lab faculty at Polytechnique Montréal.</p>
</div>

<section id="teaching" style="background: var(--bg);">
  <div class="section-label reveal">Courses</div>
  <h2 class="reveal">Current Courses</h2>
  <div class="teaching-grid reveal">
    {% for course in courses %}
      <div class="course-card">
        <div class="course-code">{{ course.code }} · {{ course.level }}</div>
        <h3>{{ course.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ course.description }}</p>
        {% if course.link %}
          <a href="{{ course.link }}" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:16px; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--blue); text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:0.06em;">Course Page →</a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--surface); padding: 80px 72px;">
  <div class="section-label reveal">Join Us</div>
  <h2 class="reveal">Prospective Students</h2>
  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:48px; align-items:start;" class="reveal">
    <div>
      <p style="color:var(--muted); font-weight:300; line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:24px;">
        We are always looking for motivated PhD and MSc candidates passionate about autonomous systems, field robotics, and space applications. Funded positions are available.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--muted); font-weight:300; line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:32px;">
        Undergraduate researchers interested in robotics are also welcome to reach out about internship opportunities and course projects.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:{% for p in collections.people | byRole('faculty') %}{{ p.data.email }}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}" class="btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-head); font-size:20px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;">What We Look For</h3>
      <ul style="list-style:none; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
        {% for item in [
          "Strong programming skills (Python, C++)",
          "Background in robotics, computer vision, or ML",
          "Experience with ROS or embedded systems (a plus)",
          "Passion for real-world, field-deployed systems",
          "Ability to work in a collaborative, international team"
        ] %}
          <li style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;">
            <span style="color:var(--blue); font-size:18px; line-height:1.3;">›</span>
            <span style="color:var(--muted); font-size:15px; font-weight:300;">{{ item }}</span>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
